dsh-superagent-windows
======================

This repository vendors the source of DeepSeek's dsh-superagent research
prototype and continues development on it. The vendored files are:

    src/  prompts/  locale/  skills/  tests/
    cordis.patch.yml  tsdown.config.ts  vitest.config.ts  tsconfig.json
    package.json  pnpm-lock.yaml  SETUP.md

