The exact revision vendored here is recorded in vendor/upstream.lock.json
(commit, commit date, package name and version). Files copied from upstream
keep their original contents; changes made in this repository are marked
with a `[fork]` note in the commit message and can be reviewed with
scripts/sync-upstream.ps1, which diffs the vendored tree against the pinned
upstream revision.

